HISTORY deselected in the extraction process, the contents of the ith           HISTORY aperture in order j can be found as follows:                            HISTORY lambda=array[*,0,{j-min(orders)}*naps + (i-1)],                         HISTORY flux=array[*,1,{j-min(orders)}*naps + (i-1)],                           HISTORY uncertainty=array[*,2,{j-min(orders)}*naps + (i-1)],                    HISTORY flag=array[*,3,{j-min(orders)}*naps + (i-1)].                           HISTORY                                                                         HISTORY The spectra in the file(s) spectra0019.fits, spectra0020.fits,          HISTORY spectra0021.fits, spectra0022.fits, spectra0023.fits,                   HISTORY spectra0024.fits, spectra0025.fits, spectra0026.fits,                   HISTORY spectra0027.fits, spectra0028.fits, spectra0029.fits,                   HISTORY spectra0030.fits, spectra0033.fits, spectra0034.fits,                   HISTORY spectra0035.fits, spectra0036.fits, spectra0037.fits,                   HISTORY spectra0038.fits were combined using a robust weighted mean             HISTORY with a sigma threshold of 8.  Aperture 1 modifications: The             HISTORY scale factors were determined using order 5 and are:                    HISTORY 0.9844431717048377, 0.8941029798521256, 0.8704387714154893,             HISTORY 0.8951839449022218, 1.06171846726052, 0.860029742133485,                HISTORY 0.856159548009898, 0.9371163709172409, 0.9836274166878282,              HISTORY 1.0433837433156317, 1.016056401662568, 1.132086152350498,               HISTORY 1.211328226221165, 1.0778981958251006, 0.9416526489940417,              HISTORY 1.051374664078713, 1.397735707687953, 1.2885106468295089.               END                                                                                                                                                                                                                                             